                                    color: ${sentimentMatch.score >= 0.7 ? '#10b981' : sentimentMatch.score >= 0.5 ? '#f59e0b' : '#ef4444'};
                                    font-weight: 600;
                                ">${(sentimentMatch.score * 100).toFixed(0)}%</span>
                            </div>
                            ${sentimentMatch.reasons && sentimentMatch.reasons.length > 0 ? `
                                <div class="coe-sentiment-reasons">
